dth:72px;height:72px"><a href="/marketplace/A0F7YS2SX-github-enterprise-server" title="GitHub Enterprise Server" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-component="inc_integration_grid" data-clog-ui-step="logo_wall_component_icon" data-clog-ui-element="logo_wall_icon_A0F7YS2SX-github-enterprise-server"><img src="https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/plugins/github/service_72.png" class="c-rounded-icon" alt="Logo of GitHub Enterprise Server"></img></a></div><div class="c-integration-grid__icon" style="background:transparent;width:72px;height:72px"><a href="/marketplace/A6NL8MJ6Q-google-drive" title="Google Drive" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-component="inc_integration_grid" data-clog-ui-step="logo_wall_component_icon" data-clog-ui-element="logo_wall_icon_A6NL8MJ6Q-google-drive"><img src="https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2020-10-15/1431340572002_5b33ac427113b206abee_72.png" class="c-rounded-icon" alt="Logo of Google Drive"></img></a></div><div class="c-integration-grid__icon" style="background:transparent;width:72px;height:72px"><a href="/marketplace/AEMQ3Q4F4-linear" title="Linear" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-component="inc_integration_grid" data-clog-ui-step="logo_wall_component_icon" data-clog-ui-element="logo_wall_icon_AEMQ3Q4F4-linear"><img src="https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2024-04-02/6911035809185_034fc1c29382232dd925_72.png" class="c-rounded-icon" alt="Logo of Linear"></img></a></div></section></div></section><section class="c-zigzag o-section--feature v--borderless  "><div class="o-content-container o-two-columns v--centered v--tablet v--inverse"><div class="c-zigzag__asset "><img loading="lazy" alt="" class="c-zig-zag__image lazyload" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/img-agents-in-slack-composer.png" data-srcset="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/img-agents-in-slack-composer.png 1x, https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/img-agents-in-slack-composer@2x.png 2x"></img></div><div class="c-zigzag__content"><div class="c-billboard__kicker"><span class="c-billboard__kicker__text c-zigzag__content__no-wrap u-text--uppercase"><span style="font-weight: 400">Agents</span>
</span></div><h2 class="c-zigzag__header">Context in Slack gives agents their superpower
</h2><div class="c-zigzag__body"><p>By connecting them to your conversations and data in Slack, agents like Agentforce, ChatGPT, Claude, Notion, Slackbot, and Writer become even more powerful and context-aware by being able to instantly (and securely) surface relevant information right where you work.</p>
</div><div></div><div class="c-zigzag__stats-header"></div><div class="c-zigzag__stats-container"></div><div class="o-section--app_garden"><p class="o-section--feature__copy"><a href="https://slack.com/marketplace/category/At07HZAKCSAC" class="link-arrow_blue" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-component="zigzag">Add third-party agents to Slack</a></p><p class="app-icon-bar"><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/icon-app-adobe-express%402x.png" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/asana-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/box-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/app-icon-cohere%402x.png" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/workday-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/app-icon-writer%402x.png" data-srcset=""></img></p></div></div></div></section><section class="c-zigzag o-section--feature v--borderless  "><div class="o-content-container o-two-columns v--centered v--tablet "><div class="c-zigzag__asset "><img loading="lazy" alt="" class="c-zig-zag__image lazyload" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/img-work-objects-integrations.png" data-srcset="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/img-work-objects-integrations.png 1x, https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/img-work-objects-integrations@2x.png 2x"></img></div><div class="c-zigzag__content"><div class="c-billboard__kicker"><span class="c-billboard__kicker__text c-zigzag__content__no-wrap u-text--uppercase"><span style="font-weight: 400">Work Objects</span>
</span></div><h2 class="c-zigzag__header">Stay current without switching between platforms
</h2><div class="c-zigzag__body"><p>Work objects reimagine how app data is shared in Slack. Instead of a simple link, you’ll get rich, interactive previews inside your conversations from apps like Asana, Pagerduty, Box, and Highspot. Edit records, mark tasks as complete, and even approve requests, all in one place.</p>
</div><div><a href="https://slack.com/integrations/work-objects" class="o-section--feature__link" style="display: block" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-component="zigzag" data-clog-ui-element="link_zigzag_cta" data-qa="" target="">Learn more about work objects</a></div><div class="c-zigzag__stats-header"></div><div class="c-zigzag__stats-container"></div></div></div></section><section class="c-zigzag o-section--feature v--borderless  "><div class="o-content-container o-two-columns v--centered v--tablet v--inverse"><div class="c-zigzag__asset "><video class="c-zig-zag__video" id="zig-zag-video-6" loop tabindex="0" muted playsinline title="Workflow Builder in Slack" poster="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/img-integrations-ui-02@2x.jpg"><source type="video/webm" src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/video-integrations-ui-02@2x.webm" media="(min-device-pixel-ratio:2), (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2), (min--moz-device-pixel-ratio:2), (-o-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/video-integrations-ui-02@2x.mp4" media="(min-device-pixel-ratio:2), (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2), (min--moz-device-pixel-ratio:2), (-o-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)"><source type="video/webm" src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/video-integrations-ui-02.webm" media="(max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (-webkit-max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (max--moz-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (-o-max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999)"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/video-integrations-ui-02.mp4" media="(max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (-webkit-max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (max--moz-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (-o-max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999)"></video><button type="button" class="c-video-control c-video-control--light" aria-pressed="false" data-js-video-control="true" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-element="btn_video_control" data-clog-ui-component="c_video_control" data-set="zig-zag-video-6"><span class="c-video-control__icon c-video-control__icon--pause" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2.5 0.9C2.5 0.623 2.723 0.4 3 0.4H4.4C4.677 0.4 4.9 0.623 4.9 0.9V11.4C4.9 11.677 4.677 11.9 4.4 11.9H3C2.723 11.9 2.5 11.677 2.5 11.4V0.9Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M7.1 0.9C7.1 0.623 7.323 0.4 7.6 0.4H9C9.277 0.4 9.5 0.623 9.5 0.9V11.4C9.5 11.677 9.277 11.9 9 11.9H7.6C7.323 11.9 7.1 11.677 7.1 11.4V0.9Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="c-video-control__icon c-video-control__icon--play" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.5 1.008V10.992C1.5 11.5 2.1 11.8 2.5 11.5L9.5 6.508C9.9 6.208 9.9 5.792 9.5 5.492L2.5 0.5C2.1 0.2 1.5 0.5 1.5 1.008Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="c-video-control__label c-video-control__label--pause">Pause animation</span><span class="c-video-control__label c-video-control__label--play">Play animation</span></button></div><div class="c-zigzag__content"><div class="c-billboard__kicker"><span class="c-billboard__kicker__text c-zigzag__content__no-wrap u-text--uppercase"></span></div><h2 class="c-zigzag__header"><strong>Speed up processes with Slack automation</strong>
</h2><div class="c-zigzag__body"><p>Add a row to a Google Sheet or create a record in Salesforce. With plug-and-play connectors in Workflow Builder, you can create app automations that work right in Slack — no coding necessary.</p>
</div><div></div><div class="c-zigzag__stats-header"></div><div class="c-zigzag__stats-container"></div><div class="o-section--app_garden"><p class="o-section--feature__copy"><a href="https://slack.com/marketplace/collection/workflow-automation" class="link-arrow_blue" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-component="zigzag">Connect your tools and workflows</a></p><p class="app-icon-bar"><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/salesforce-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/jira-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/box-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/google-sheets-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/zoom-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/asana-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/docusign-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img></p></div></div></div></section><section class="c-zigzag o-section--feature v--borderless  "><div class="o-content-container o-two-columns v--centered v--tablet "><div class="c-zigzag__asset "><video class="c-zig-zag__video" id="zig-zag-video-7" loop tabindex="0" muted playsinline title="Google Doc and Google Drive apps notifications in Slack" poster="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/img-integrations-ui-03@2x.jpg"><source type="video/webm" src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/video-integrations-ui-03@2x.webm" media="(min-device-pixel-ratio:2), (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2), (min--moz-device-pixel-ratio:2), (-o-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/video-integrations-ui-03@2x.mp4" media="(min-device-pixel-ratio:2), (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2), (min--moz-device-pixel-ratio:2), (-o-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)"><source type="video/webm" src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/video-integrations-ui-03.webm" media="(max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (-webkit-max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (max--moz-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (-o-max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999)"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/video-integrations-ui-03.mp4" media="(max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (-webkit-max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (max--moz-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999), (-o-max-device-pixel-ratio:1.9999)"></video><button type="button" class="c-video-control c-video-control--light" aria-pressed="false" data-js-video-control="true" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-element="btn_video_control" data-clog-ui-component="c_video_control" data-set="zig-zag-video-7"><span class="c-video-control__icon c-video-control__icon--pause" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2.5 0.9C2.5 0.623 2.723 0.4 3 0.4H4.4C4.677 0.4 4.9 0.623 4.9 0.9V11.4C4.9 11.677 4.677 11.9 4.4 11.9H3C2.723 11.9 2.5 11.677 2.5 11.4V0.9Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M7.1 0.9C7.1 0.623 7.323 0.4 7.6 0.4H9C9.277 0.4 9.5 0.623 9.5 0.9V11.4C9.5 11.677 9.277 11.9 9 11.9H7.6C7.323 11.9 7.1 11.677 7.1 11.4V0.9Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="c-video-control__icon c-video-control__icon--play" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.5 1.008V10.992C1.5 11.5 2.1 11.8 2.5 11.5L9.5 6.508C9.9 6.208 9.9 5.792 9.5 5.492L2.5 0.5C2.1 0.2 1.5 0.5 1.5 1.008Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="c-video-control__label c-video-control__label--pause">Pause animation</span><span class="c-video-control__label c-video-control__label--play">Play animation</span></button></div><div class="c-zigzag__content"><div class="c-billboard__kicker"><span class="c-billboard__kicker__text c-zigzag__content__no-wrap u-text--uppercase"></span></div><h2 class="c-zigzag__header"><strong>Add ease and efficiency to your everyday</strong>
</h2><div class="c-zigzag__body"><p>Small tasks are big time-wasters. Bring your apps into Slack to update file permissions, manage your calendar, approve requests, and so much more with just a click.</p>
</div><div></div><div class="c-zigzag__stats-header"></div><div class="c-zigzag__stats-container"></div><div class="o-section--app_garden"><p class="o-section--feature__copy"><a href="https://slack.com/marketplace/category/At0EFXUU6N-productivity" class="link-arrow_blue" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-component="zigzag">Browse productivity apps</a></p><p class="app-icon-bar"><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/outlook-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/google-drive-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/salesforce-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/aws-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img><img class="o-media-object__media lazyload" width="36" alt="" loading="lazy" data-src="https://d34u8crftukxnk.cloudfront.net/slackpress/prod/sites/6/workday-app-icon%402x.jpg" data-srcset=""></img></p></div></div></div></section><section class="o-section--feature v--borderless"><div class="o-content-container"><h2 class="o-section--feature__headline">Build and customize apps and agents in Slack</h2><div class="o-section--feature__copy u-margin-bottom--medium">Build custom solutions that meet your unique needs. With more than 550K custom integrations used daily, Slack works with the tools and processes you already use while keeping your data secure.</div><div class="c-feature-tiles v--four"><a class="c-feature-tile full" href="https://docs.slack.dev/" data-clog-click data-clog-ui-element="link_feature_tile" data-clog-ui-c